 "f": "bright warm ambient lighting, clean cream-beige metallic surfaces, glossy chrome and glass finishes, golden amber rim lights, blue only on digital screens, high production value, pristine clean environment, reflective polished floors, soft diffused overhead lighting, no dark shadows, bright and airy atmosphere",
